## Import

Silences can be imported using the format `cluster_type/cluster_name/silence_id`:

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/axonops_silence/import.sh" }}

Where:
- `cluster_type` - The type of cluster (cassandra, kafka, or dse)
- `cluster_name` - The name of the cluster
- `silence_id` - The UUID of the silence window, as returned by the AxonOps API

> **Note:** The `note` attribute requires an AxonOps server newer than `2.0.39`. Against older servers the provider still accepts the attribute, but the server silently ignores it, so `terraform plan` shows a persistent diff. Omit `note` when targeting an AxonOps server `<= 2.0.39`.
